# No environment variables are required for local transcription.
#
# The YouTube audio converter can read public metadata without these values, but
# Google Cloud Run egress may trigger YouTube authentication checks for downloads.
# Configure either a YouTube cookie, or both visitor data and a PO token, only for
# content you own or have permission to download.
#
# YOUTUBE_COOKIE=
# YOUTUBE_VISITOR_DATA=
# YOUTUBE_PO_TOKEN=
